# PROJECT TITLE: LearnHub — Learning Management System (LMS)

## 1. ROLE AND PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Act as a professional frontend developer, React.js engineer, UI/UX designer, and responsive web development specialist.

Build a complete, modern, professional, portfolio-quality Learning Management System (LMS) named **LearnHub** using React.js, Vite, Tailwind CSS, React Router, and Lucide React.

The website should allow students to discover courses, explore course details, enroll in courses, access lessons, mark lessons as completed, and track their learning progress through a personalized learning dashboard.

The project must fulfill every mandatory requirement in the provided Frontend Task 6 PDF. Do not skip pages, features, interactions, responsive layouts, testing requirements, or deployment configurations.

The final website should look like a real educational platform that could be presented to a client, employer, or university instructor.

**Important:** This is a frontend-only project. Do not create a backend, database, authentication server, payment system, or paid API integration.

All course data must come from local JavaScript files, while enrollment and completed lesson progress must be saved in the browser's localStorage.

